==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{recons|ōþ-|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{proto|ine-pro|āt-|race, people|lang=ang}}.
Germanic cognates include Old Frisian ''ēþel'', Old High German [[uodil]], Old Norse [[óðal]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈeːðel/|lang=ang}}

